        <updated>2025-02-01T16:49:46.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Overview
This release is available for these models:

E7

Improvements

Improved 6GHz Auto channel selection algorithm.

Bugfixes

Fixed 6GHz SSIDs occasionally not broadcasting after a configuration change when "Extended 6 GHz Range" is enabled.

Additional information
If you encounter any issues with this release, please provide us with some details on your setup and include the below information:

AP model(s)
Previous AP release version
UniFi Network application version
Please post a support file as well]]></summary>
